  "title": "· New Bags | Prada Unveils Spring/Summer 2027 Womenswear Show: Deconstructed Skirts ·",
  "original_title": "新包 | Prada 发布2027春夏女装秀：半裙解构",
  "excerpt": "Prada's Spring/Summer 2027 Milan show themed \"The Skirt\" explored creative possibilities with Velcro, crystals, and regenerated nylon.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
  "date_iso": "2026-09-28",
  "date_label": "September 28, 2026",
  "cover_image": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/t5mhj4a/c0fcf3aded312aab.jpg",
