    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Prada Spring/Summer 2027 womenswear show has just wrapped in Milan, and this season's collection takes \"The Skirt\" as its theme. Co-creative directors Miuccia Prada and Raf Simons built their ideas around the skirt as a timeless wardrobe staple, playing with unexpected design elements — contrast-color Velcro, crystal embroidery, metal snap fasteners, and regenerated nylon — and mixing and matching pieces to explore the endless creative possibilities that exist within a framework of constraint.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The skirt is a contemporary object; its flexibility and adaptability lie in its ability to hold contradictions. — Miuccia Prada",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
