    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new season's bags center on an east-west horizontal silhouette, paired with slender leather handles that can be carried by hand or slung over the shoulder for a crisp, confident attitude. The new Galleria is given a contrast-color effect through a spray-dye process, accented by a tonal enamel triangle logo — like a graffiti work still in progress.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
