    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new bags pair a clean rectangular outline with a top zip closure, their crisp geometric lines embodying a \"less is more\" minimalist ethos. This group is crafted in cotton canvas, with the brand logo reduced to a solid-color triangle that echoes the enamel triangle logo at the side, and comes in shades including snow white, grass green, iris purple, black, and gray.",
